### Create Abonnement (via API Gateway)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/api
@directUrl = http://localhost:4009

POST {{baseUrl}}/abonnements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "cityId": 1,
  "type": "MONTHLY",
  "startDate": "2025-11-16"
}

### Direct to service (no gateway)
# POST {{directUrl}}/abonnements
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "userId": 1,
#   "cityId": 1,
#   "type": "MONTHLY",
#   "startDate": "2025-11-16"
# }
